/T (Welcome to REMINISCENCE 3.0,a scientific confrence focused on  EXPLORING THE FUTURE OF INTERVENTIONAL PULMONOLOGY.  This event provides a platform for clinicians,respiratory therapist,healthcare professionals,academicians and student to exchange knowledge,explore emerging technologies,and discuss the latest advancements in interventional pulmomology. Through expert lectures,interactive sessions,and hands-on workshops, we hope to inspire innovation, strengthen collaboration, and promote excellence in respiratory care.)
